 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Cloud Dataproc API (v1) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. Autoscaling policies and session templates under projects.locations are configuration metadata (formerly Dataproc): no cluster, batch, session, Spark application or autoscaler runs, and no policy is attached to anything. Updates replace the whole policy or template, as the official methods do, and cannot change its ID. Clusters, jobs, batches, sessions and workflow templates run or describe workloads and are unimplemented, as are the projects.regions paths.",
  "title": "Managed Service for Apache Spark (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "v1"
 },
